<p>
Hey,I'm Maverick, you may have seen me on Netstorm,you may not have, but this is my first attempt at a Netstorm campaign.  Please bare with me and e-mail me if you have any trouble at <a href="mailto:mav07@hotmail.com">mav07@hotmail.com</a>  Thanx and have fun.

